($v^{\gp}=p^{\gp}h^{\gp}$), so $\psi^{\gp}(Q'^{\gp})
={GF}(v)\Z\subseteq{GF}(p)\Z$; define
$u^{\gp}:=(\pi^{\gp})^{-1}\circ(\psi^{\gp}/{GF}(p))$ where
